  <string name="setup_privacy_description">Network access is used only after you explicitly download the optional local model. Typed text is never sent. Rune has no telemetry, ads, input history, or clipboard access.</string>
  <string name="setup_mvp_note">Rune 0.2 adds delivery and a self-test for one optional local model. The model is not connected to typing. Swipe typing, suggestions, punctuation and autocorrect are intentionally out of scope.</string>

